or something like that.

00:06:52.703 --> 00:06:55.597
- They go by too slowly to
have any doppler effect at all.

00:06:55.597 --> 00:06:56.430
(laughing)

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:58.348
- Well in New York they do, yeah.

00:06:58.348 --> 00:06:59.963
As a matter of fact.
- In rush hour.

00:06:59.963 --> 00:07:01.200
- It's one stuck in traffic, right?

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:02.870
No doppler effect.
- Every time I see

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:04.177
an ambulance in New York, I'm like,

00:07:04.177 --> 00:07:05.189
"That guy is dead."

00:07:05.189 --> 00:07:06.022
(laughing)

00:07:06.022 --> 00:07:07.370
- Chuck!

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:08.850
- Just sayin'.

00:07:08.850 --> 00:07:10.870
Its like sitting at a
light for 20 minutes.

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:12.190
Woo, woo!

00:07:12.190 --> 00:07:13.270
- It's behind ya and
nobody knows how to move.

00:07:13.270 --> 00:07:16.900
- Right, and nobody's moving
and its trapped on the street.

00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:18.180
All right, sorry, go ahead.

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:20.710
- You need drones to carry these folks.

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:22.270
- And so, if you're
going through a wormhole,

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:23.410
you're not having these doppler effects

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:24.415
and so you're not gonna
have frequency changes.

00:07:24.415 --> 00:07:25.810
- [Liu] That's right,
it's a different dynamic.

00:07:25.810 --> 00:07:27.980
If you're close to a black hole,

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:30.580
sort of like in the movie Interstellar,

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:34.030
you do have things
change in terms of light

00:07:34.030 --> 00:07:36.010
and sound and those kind of things,

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:38.190
but in order to really predict

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:41.980
what's happening in terms of
superluminal communications,

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:45.260
I think we are well beyond normal science

00:07:45.260 --> 00:07:47.360
as we understand it now,
and like the Orville,

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:48.780
we're totally in fiction.

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:50.936
- Okay, all right.
- All right, next one.

00:07:50.936 --> 00:07:53.730
