00:45:36.598 --> 00:45:37.650
- That's really what it is.

00:45:37.650 --> 00:45:38.550
- It's too boring

00:45:38.550 --> 00:45:39.383
for the camera.
- You want to be stately,

00:45:39.383 --> 00:45:40.900
