trapped in there for decades.

00:47:54.380 --> 00:47:55.450
Well, there is a quantum realm.

00:47:55.450 --> 00:47:58.230
The question is, can you
function as a normal person

00:47:58.230 --> 00:47:59.150
in a quantum realm?

00:47:59.150 --> 00:48:00.260
